# Not a regression: the pinned node with every known bug fixed, built as
# bedrock/tempo-localnet:known-fixes for campaigns hunting new bugs. Any
# failure on it is a novel-bug candidate (or a missing entry here).
#
# - reth#27615 (unmerged): historical overlays miss transient trie nodes.
# - WorkerMap self-join: storage-workers panics "failed to join thread:
#   Resource deadlock avoided" when the last Runtime drops on the worker
#   (crates/tasks/src/worker_map.rs; upstream: paradigmxyz/reth#27805).
# - reth#27817 (unmerged): eth_getProof via V2 proofs, fixing extra inline-leaf
#   proof nodes (tempoxyz/bedrock#14).
# - tempo#8189 (unmerged): dev miner timestamps advance past the parent,
#   fixing self-rejected blocks (tempoxyz/bedrock#13).
BASE_RETH_PRS="27615:30904dc4158defd496565da8f28671af81096091 27817:733a14c10acd40ebdf16a8a60255051722e55c93"
BASE_TEMPO_PRS="8189:75d7773eb77a8866301936c7ac0de6c61a70ff7b"
BASE_RETH_PATCHES="worker-map-self-join.patch"
VARIANT=default
CAMPAIGN_ARGS="--load trie"
